{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to Villainville!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/8776246ae1d50fb78236e5f551c6f48a.avif?t=1757308532\" width=312 height=420 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations\u2013you\u2019ve made a deal with the devil. Or, close enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a bankrupt royal on the run from your kingdom\u2019s creditors after grandpappy Midas upended the value of gold. In exchange for a new identity on the island of Batwing, you\u2019ve agreed to help Lord Oberon\u2013an elder vampire\u2013stop the misery mushroom plague and catch whoever started it. He\u2019s in a power struggle with the Organization of Fairy Godmothers over control for Batwing island, and in the middle of the mess no one is looking out for the outcast fairy tale islanders\u2013except you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the island\u2019s underbelly to sleuth out the truth of who started the misery plague in this player-responsive story with mini mysteries and multiple outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise enchanting farm animals to restore the protective magic of the land\u2013including tiny darling but deadly unicorns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create an entirely new identity\u2013complete with tattoos, horns, and fantasy-inspired eye shapes and ears</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and befriend--if you can--quirky creatures in habitats such as the island's graveyards, and strangely beautiful mines</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/edcd6c1f9646e08ec7487e79112735b6.poster.avif?t=1757308532\" width=310 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/edcd6c1f9646e08ec7487e79112735b6.webm?t=1757308532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/edcd6c1f9646e08ec7487e79112735b6.mp4?t=1757308532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast aside your rusty old weapons\u2013as a farmer, you\u2019ll search out tool treasures such as an epic axe that takes out an entire swath of trees with one throw</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the rich stories behind Batwing Island\u2019s 60+ upended fairytale NPCs to forge friendships, resolve fights, and create a community out of outlaws</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/532f3a6655ff57c2f29680c1ed52c2cf.avif?t=1757308532\" width=1000 height=708 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fascinating open world and dispel illusions to reveal secrets resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Date the island\u2019s cuties, from a big bad wolf who is not what he seems to a washed up siren, or the numerous out-of-luck island heroes and royals. Romantic relationships are an option in becoming bond mates but not required\u2013and every kind of familial bond is possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/4e5a3637bb335a061d9b58ba4d279341.avif?t=1757308532\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow an array of magic crops, from ghost peppers, to pumpkins that ripen into jack-o-lanterns, and night-harvested blood bag tomatoes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access the island\u2019s night market and meet your fellow creatures of the moon, with quests, NPCs, and shops for the nocturnal types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your heebie-jeebie meter through anxiety-reducing techniques (as well as crafting home-grown elixirs), and save the island from the encroaching misery mushrooms</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3488670?t=1757308532","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3488670?t=1757308532","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/c244ff7ac8c3ce9bece121837c98a82af0c14651/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757308532","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/c244ff7ac8c3ce9bece121837c98a82af0c14651/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757308532","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to Villainville!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/8776246ae1d50fb78236e5f551c6f48a.avif?t=1757308532\" width=312 height=420 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\